      "headings": [
        "Language Acquisition & Sound Recognition Lab",
        "Welcome to the LASR Lab!"
      ],
      "text": "Search this site Embedded Files LASR Lab Language Acquisition & Sound Recognition Lab Welcome to the LASR Lab! Since 2008, we have been making breakthroughs in language studies. By utilizing linguistics, machine learning, neuroscience, and more, we are able to discover more and more about language development and processing. We hope you find our research as interesting as we do, and we look forward to working with you in the future! -The LASR Lab We try to answer questions such as: What really goes through children's minds as they're learning to speak? How do fluent bilingual speakers perceive speech differently from those who are monolingual? How do people infer a speaker's gender? How well do neural network speech recognition systems perform with speakers outside their training data? And more! Learn more about our current studies here: Kid Studies Adult Studies Report abuse Page details Page updated Report abuse",
